  "protocol": "32 frontiers, 2048-token incremental prefill and 128 greedy decode tokens per frontier in one warm session, fresh process per run. Two runs of main 8436382 (#48, absorbed-MLA prefill; a third was stopped when the campaign was redirected), three runs of 007f0e4 (#49: expanded-MLA prefill, decode HG split fill) on the same resident owner, and three runs of the PR #50 binary (BF16 K/V scratch, 64-key tiles, three-chunk segments) on a fresh owner of the same artifact later the same morning. Summary is the median of run means. Plot curves are per-frontier medians with observed min/max bands. Between frontiers ds4-bench restores the prefix by replaying it (the recurrent state has no rewind); that replay is outside both measured phases. Ling has no MTP.",
